        (large-stress)
        *title Large table and many segments
        *atmos none
        *earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
        *trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
          *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=1 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
          *file stress.dat time tseg xecfc xecfcdt thrust
          *segment 1 stress-1
  *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05
  *prop thrust=(stress-thrust)
  *when time=0.5 goto 2
*segment 2 stress-2
  *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05
  *prop thrust=(stress-thrust)
  *when time=1.0 goto 3
